  </data>
  <data name="ListItem_Bubble_ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The Bubble chart is an extension of the Point chart but each point can be a circle or oval of any size or dimension. The bubble size may be used to convey larger values.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ListItem_CandleStick" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Candle Stick</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ListItem_CandleStick_ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The CandleStick chart combines bar and line chart styles to show a range of value movement over time. Dark colored bars show downward trends, light colored bars show upward trends and the line through the center (the "wick") shows the extreme high and low values.</value>
  </data>
